# Delivery policy

This template does not choose a hosting provider, CI service, container platform, or infrastructure tool.

Before adding delivery automation:

- record the target environment, trigger, configuration source, health check, rollback method, and owner in a spec;
- keep secrets outside the repository;
- build once and promote the same verified artifact when the platform supports it;
- separate release/versioning from deployment;
- ask for explicit confirmation before creating resources, publishing artifacts, or deploying.

Do not reject a technology merely because another project used a different platform. Judge it against this project's accepted constraints.
